{"meta":{"id":"pom-xml","category":"it/syntax/spring/setup","title":"pom.xml (버전 · 라이브러리) · Spring","subtitle":"(SPRING)","summary":"properties 버전 변수, dependency 연결, maven.compiler, Lombok 설치","tags":["spring","f-build","f-config"],"color":"teal","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-teal","source":"언어별사용 정리.xlsx","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-teal-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-teal-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-teal-50 text-teal-700 border border-teal-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></span>SPRING</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">pom.xml (버전 · 라이브러리) · Spring</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-teal-50/70 border border-teal-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-teal-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> properties 버전 변수, dependency 연결, maven.compiler, Lombok 설치</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">pom.xml — 버전 변수 · 라이브러리 연결</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">xml</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">&lt;properties&gt;\r\n  &lt;java-version&gt;11&lt;/java-version&gt;\r\n  &lt;org.springframework-version&gt;4.3.14.RELEASE&lt;/org.springframework-version&gt;\r\n  &lt;org.aspectj-version&gt;1.6.10&lt;/org.aspectj-version&gt;\r\n  &lt;org.slf4j-version&gt;1.6.6&lt;/org.slf4j-version&gt;\r\n  &lt;maven.compiler.source&gt;11&lt;/maven.compiler.source&gt;   &lt;!-- Maven 컴파일 java 버전 --&gt;\r\n  &lt;maven.compiler.target&gt;11&lt;/maven.compiler.target&gt;\r\n&lt;/properties&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;dependencies&gt;\r\n  &lt;dependency&gt;\r\n    &lt;groupId&gt;org.springframework&lt;/groupId&gt;\r\n    &lt;artifactId&gt;spring-webmvc&lt;/artifactId&gt;\r\n    &lt;version&gt;${org.springframework-version}&lt;/version&gt;   &lt;!-- properties 값을 변수로 사용 --&gt;\r\n  &lt;/dependency&gt;\r\n\r\n  &lt;!-- lombok --&gt;\r\n  &lt;dependency&gt;\r\n    &lt;groupId&gt;org.projectlombok&lt;/groupId&gt;\r\n    &lt;artifactId&gt;lombok&lt;/artifactId&gt;\r\n    &lt;version&gt;1.18.24&lt;/version&gt;\r\n    &lt;scope&gt;provided&lt;/scope&gt;\r\n  &lt;/dependency&gt;\r\n&lt;/dependencies&gt;</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">정리</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>&lt;properties&gt;</code> 안에 만든 태그는 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>${이름}</code> 변수로 사용 가능</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">라이브러리는 mvnrepository.com 에서 검색해 dependency 를 복사</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">java 버전 · Maven 컴파일 버전 · Spring 버전을 맞춘다 (예: java 11 / Spring 4.3.14.RELEASE / maven.compiler 11)</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">Lombok 은 STS 에도 설치 — <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>SpringToolSuite4.ini</code> 에 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>-javaagent:경로\\lombok.jar</code> 추가</span></div></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-teal-700 font-semibold\">원본 메모의 maven 예시는 &lt;properties&gt; 안에 &lt;dependency&gt; 가 들어가 있었는데, maven.compiler.* 는 properties 에, dependency 는 dependencies 에 둔다.</p><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> Java › 빌드 설정 (Gradle · Maven), TypeScript › tsconfig.json</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/spring/setup/pom-xml","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"spring","title":"SPRING","path":"it/syntax/spring"},{"id":"setup","title":"기본 연결 · 설정","path":"it/syntax/spring/setup"}],"hasImage":false}